23
00:00:44.500 --> 00:00:46.550 line:88% position:50% size:90%
Compare the child's pattern with development
and

24
00:00:46.560 --> 00:00:49.390 line:88% position:50% size:90%
history, rather than treating one isolated age

25
00:00:49.400 --> 00:00:50.280 line:88% position:50% size:90%
as a diagnosis.

26
00:00:50.700 --> 00:00:53.210 line:88% position:50% size:90%
Some slide entries are abbreviated or contain

27
