50
00:01:41.210 --> 00:01:43.880 line:88% position:50% size:90%
Examine the lips, tongue, jaw, sensation, and

51
00:01:43.890 --> 00:01:44.540 line:88% position:50% size:90%
coordination.

52
00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:47.040 line:88% position:50% size:90%
In the course's bedside assessment, a client

53
00:01:47.050 --> 00:01:48.700 line:88% position:50% size:90%
who is not alert, or whose known

54
00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:51.000 line:88% position:50% size:90%
